cpp.solutions:
## solutions

#### iterative

```cpp
bool isUnivalueList(Node* head) {
  Node* current = head;
  while (current != nullptr) {
    if (current->val != head->val) {
      return false;
    }
    current = current->next;
  }
  return true;
}
```

- n = number of nodes
- Time: O(n)
- Space: O(1)

#### recursive

```cpp
bool isUnivalueList(Node* current, Node* head) {
  if (current == nullptr) {
    return true;
  }

  if (current->val != head->val) {
    return false;
  }

  return isUnivalueList(current->next, head);
}

bool isUnivalueList(Node* head) {
  isUnivalueList(head, head);
}
```

- n = number of nodes
- Time: O(n)
- Space: O(n)
